WEBVTT

00:07:59.708 --> 00:08:01.393
Keep absolutely still.

00:08:01.417 --> 00:08:02.976
Are you standing? Where are you?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.893
Man: I am standing. I'm not that short.

00:08:04.917 --> 00:08:06.167
DB: OK.

00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:09.684
Alright, now you changed that.

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:11.934
There was just something
you did as you got up.

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:14.976
Yes or no, have you
put something on here --

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.726
you're not doing it now,
but you did it as you stood up --

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:22.268
to do with your left or your left leg
or your left foot, yes or no?

00:08:22.292 --> 00:08:23.559
Man: Yes.

00:08:23.583 --> 00:08:26.768
DB: Alright. He was giving us
a nice clear signal as he stood up.

00:08:26.792 --> 00:08:29.309
Put your weight on your
left-hand side and say "yes."

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:30.601
Man: Yes.